    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classaxi_1_1axi__initiator" kindref="compound">axi_initiator</ref> class provides an input_socket for incoming TLM transactions. It attaches AXI extension to the tlm_generic_payload and forwards it to the AXI Protocol Engine. </para>
